// Get info about TOP ingested tables
Usage
| where TimeGenerated > ago(3d)
| summarize DataGB = round(sum(Quantity) / 1024, 2) by DataType
| order by DataGB desc

Usage
| where TimeGenerated > ago(3d)
| summarize DataMB = round(sum(Quantity), 2) by DataType
| order by DataMB desc

Fortinet_CL
| where TimeGenerated > ago(3d)
| summarize Records = count()